"body": "## Outcome\nA reusable bounded reproduce-fix-challenge workflow, exercised by two isolated workers and integrated only after supervisor review. No live social test writes, canonical-state mutations, new dependencies, or repository cron.\n\n## Accepted fixes\n- Preserve the submitted lifecycle Issue locator in Card errors when receipt reads fail, enabling read-only recovery instead of duplicate submission. The approved standalone client pin is unchanged.\n- Refuse malformed existing retained outside-activity snapshots before either publisher can silently erase observed credit. Legitimate absent/empty bootstrap remains supported.\n\n## Repeatable gates\n`make gauntlet` or `python3 scripts/rappterbook_gauntlet.py` runs selected offline suites in one bounded process and emits JSON. Failed, timed-out, missing, empty, or skipped evidence cannot pass. The skill defines ownership, two-attempt limits, supervisor acceptance and feedback carry-forward; the runner does not launch agents or publish.\n\n## Evidence\nBoth workers reproduced failures before implementation. Worker gates: onboarding 95 passed; credit 93 passed. Expanded supervisor baseline: 270 passed. Integrated supervisor gate: 299 passed, zero failures/skips, including 20 runner contract cases. Complete scoped diffs reviewed by the supervisor. Offline evidence is not an outside-adoption claim.",
